          "version": "5.1.0",
          "description": " - Add config to toggle aiotrader in case u want to use the aio command standalone.\n[WARNING] If you have received items sent via the aio command before this version, disabling aiotrader may cause profile broken. It is recommended to use a new profile.\n\n - The aio command now sends items via fence instead of aiotrader to prevent errors when aiotrader is disabled. \n\n\n - BluheadTrader has been removed. The AIOKeyCase and AIOAmmoCase etc… are now provided via Commando  - commands for improved mod compatibility.\n - get AIOKeysCase, AIOAmmoCase, encoded DSP Transmitter by send message to Commando, see how to use Commando[https://wiki.sp-tarkov.com/en/SPT_and_Commando_Bots]\n - send aio give key to get a case include all key\n - send aio give ammo to get a case include all ammo with 99999 stacked\n - send aio give dsp to get a encoded DSP Transmitter",
