          "version": "4.0.2",
          "description": "update for apt 3.9.8\n\nSince Tarkov has more and more items, AIOTrader is loading slower and slower, so I optimized trader loading speed by:\n\n1\\. Remove all keys &amp; cards from AIOTrader since you can buy them from bluehead trader\n\n2\\. Remove all ammo &amp; ammo packs from AIOTrader since you can buy all ammo from bluehead trader\n\n3\\. Remove all built-in plates of armor vest from AIOTrader since you can not customize them anyway.\n\n4\\. Sell all mod parts separately in AIOTraderPart2\n\n5\\. All these features can be toggled via the config\n\nLet me know your thoughts on these changes by leaving a comment, good luck : )",
